flowchart TD
    A[Crawler/Scraper] --> B[crm_leads raw]
    B --> C[Enrichment Waterfall 50+ sources]
    C --> D{Enriched?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Omega Scoring]
    D -->|No| F[Dead lead]
    E --> G[omega_tier: BRONZE/SILVER/GOLD]
    G --> H{ICP Tier}
    H -->|High| I[Campaign B: Enterprise Direct]
    H -->|Standard| J[Campaign A: Value-First]
    I --> K[Buyer Claims Lead]
    J --> K
    K --> L[si_invoice Created]
    L --> M[Buyer Pays USDT BSC]
    M --> N[BSC Listener Confirms]
    N --> O[Payout to Vault]
    O --> P[Lead Delivered Email/Webhook]
    P --> Q[Revenue Recognized]
    Q --> R[MRR Updated]
    
    style A fill:#00BFFF,color:#0a0a12
    style C fill:#0D47A1,color:#fff
    style E fill:#39FF14,color:#0a0a12
    style L fill:#FFD700,color:#0a0a12
    style O fill:#FF4444,color:#fff
